    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Aiyana woke up in a forest with her memory gone. </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/5114eb1ede2181abe2d6c74886259ee1.poster.avif?t=1709694301\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/5114eb1ede2181abe2d6c74886259ee1.webm?t=1709694301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/5114eb1ede2181abe2d6c74886259ee1.mp4?t=1709694301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Florarium is a bow action-adventure game. Master the bow in the unique world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engaging Battle</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Battle against challenging bosses. <br></li><li>Find and upgrade skills to match your playstyle.<br></li><li>Fast-paced ranged battle without the need to aim.<br></li><li>Test your limit in the underground colosseum. </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/23fd9747d5b0ed59b53fd4fa832610d1.poster.avif?t=1709694301\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/23fd9747d5b0ed59b53fd4fa832610d1.webm?t=1709694301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/23fd9747d5b0ed59b53fd4fa832610d1.mp4?t=1709694301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/76e237083626b6c0a84470814b8ca498.poster.avif?t=1709694301\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/76e237083626b6c0a84470814b8ca498.webm?t=1709694301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/76e237083626b6c0a84470814b8ca498.mp4?t=1709694301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/dde558b0519c0c349f05beddd888628f.poster.avif?t=1709694301\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/dde558b0519c0c349f05beddd888628f.webm?t=1709694301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/dde558b0519c0c349f05beddd888628f.mp4?t=1709694301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beautiful world to explore</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>12+ unique regions, 150+ maps connected carefully.<br></li><li>Numerous blocked paths to the new region, waiting to be passed. <br></li><li>Each region with memorable boss fights and stories.<br></li><li>Uncover the secrets and mysteries.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Aiyana woke up in a forest with her memory gone. </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/5114eb1ede2181abe2d6c74886259ee1.poster.avif?t=1709694301\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/5114eb1ede2181abe2d6c74886259ee1.webm?t=1709694301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/5114eb1ede2181abe2d6c74886259ee1.mp4?t=1709694301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Florarium is a bow action-adventure game. Master the bow in the unique world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engaging Battle</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Battle against challenging bosses. <br></li><li>Find and upgrade skills to match your playstyle.<br></li><li>Fast-paced ranged battle without the need to aim.<br></li><li>Test your limit in the underground colosseum. </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/23fd9747d5b0ed59b53fd4fa832610d1.poster.avif?t=1709694301\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/23fd9747d5b0ed59b53fd4fa832610d1.webm?t=1709694301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/23fd9747d5b0ed59b53fd4fa832610d1.mp4?t=1709694301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/76e237083626b6c0a84470814b8ca498.poster.avif?t=1709694301\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/76e237083626b6c0a84470814b8ca498.webm?t=1709694301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/76e237083626b6c0a84470814b8ca498.mp4?t=1709694301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/dde558b0519c0c349f05beddd888628f.poster.avif?t=1709694301\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/dde558b0519c0c349f05beddd888628f.webm?t=1709694301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/dde558b0519c0c349f05beddd888628f.mp4?t=1709694301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beautiful world to explore</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>12+ unique regions, 150+ maps connected carefully.<br></li><li>Numerous blocked paths to the new region, waiting to be passed. <br></li><li>Each region with memorable boss fights and stories.<br></li><li>Uncover the secrets and mysteries.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Florarium is a Metroidvania game focused on exploration and battle. Explore the mysterious world full of unexpected secrets. Battle fierce enemies with your bow. Choose your own path to your goddess in the vast, interconnected world.",
